{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgorR4Zx9eTA1kq3S7ved","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd stop here and swipe away.\n\n**What I'd tell my friend:** \"So the site has this page, 'מה האתר עוד לא מכסה', and it's basically a never-ending list of cards, every one with a red 'לא מחושב' tag. What I caught: ETC, gold (LBMA, gold through קרנות סל), אג\"ח קונצרניות, אגרת בונדס, a digital currency wallet, all sorts of insurance stuff like ביטוח מנהלים and ביטוח חיים משתתף ברווחים, היוון קצבה, הסדר חוב, מנוטרלת מט\"ח, מוצר מובנה, מענק, מסלולי אירוע, deposits in dollars or other currencies, ני\"ע, צמוד דולר, פיקדון מובנה. The red box up top says the rules for all of these are still being checked, so the site doesn't calculate them. I'm fairly sure of the gist, but I didn't get to the end. Honestly it's kind of good news: I didn't see ETF, S&P or Nasdaq anywhere in what I scrolled, so my index fund idea is maybe covered somewhere else on the site. But I'm not sure, because I quit halfway.\"\n\n**My account:**\n- **What I looked at, in order:** the title and the red box, then the bold card titles plus the red \"לא מחושב\" tags, through about screen 6 of 10.\n- **What I skipped:** the full \"מה ידוע\" sentences, all the blue law links, the dates, the \"מקור ראשי\" chips and the grey \"כשייסגר…\" lines. I also never got to screens 7 to 10.\n- **Where I got bored:** around \"פיקדון מובנה\" and \"צמוד דולר\" on screen 6. It's a wall of dark cards packed with legal text and law names, and none of it is stuff I'd actually buy.\n- **Where I hesitated:** some cards have an open \"מצב הכיסוי\" section with \"חסום: שאלה פתוחה אחת\" and codes like \"TXA-28\" or \"MF-28\". I didn't know if that meant less covered or more covered. There were also crossed-out \"נסגר ב-\" dates, and I couldn't tell if crossed out meant done or cancelled.\n- **Words I didn't get:** ETC, LBMA, אג\"ח קונצרניות, אגרת בונדס, היוון קצבה, מנוט